WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.040
Cow was jogging.

2
00:00:07.041 --> 00:00:09.699
She was looking at the sky.

3
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.766
"Pretty clouds," she said.

4
00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:16.658
Cow wasn't looking at the ground.

5
00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:19.068
And she tripped on a hole.

6
00:00:19.069 --> 00:00:24.517
"Oof!" said Cow.

7
00:00:24.518 --> 00:00:30.616
Cat was skipping.

8
00:00:30.617 --> 00:00:34.029
"La-la-la!" sang Cat.

9
00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.480
Cat wasn't looking at the ground.

10
00:00:37.481 --> 00:00:43.153
"Oof!" said Cat.

11
00:00:43.154 --> 00:00:49.185
Dog was running.

12
00:00:49.186 --> 00:00:52.266
"Woof! Woof!" he said.

13
00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:55.088
Dog wasn't looking at the ground.

14
00:00:55.089 --> 00:01:00.666
"Oof!" said Dog.

15
00:01:00.667 --> 00:01:05.492
Pig was walking.

16
00:01:05.493 --> 00:01:10.451
"I'm hungry," he said.

17
00:01:10.452 --> 00:01:14.127
"I want to eat all this corn."

18
00:01:14.128 --> 00:01:16.782
Something popped up under Pig.

19
00:01:16.783 --> 00:01:21.324
"Oof!" said Pig.

20
00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:27.747
Bat was eating bugs.

21
00:01:27.748 --> 00:01:30.938
"Yum," he said.

22
00:01:30.939 --> 00:01:36.819
Suddenly Bat fell in a hole.

23
00:01:36.820 --> 00:01:39.817
"Oof!" said Bat.

24
00:01:39.818 --> 00:01:46.475
Bat sat up.

25
00:01:46.476 --> 00:01:55.474
He looked around.

26
00:01:55.475 --> 00:02:02.657
"Hello?" he said.

